        {
          "text": "pele walo mwini wakeenda lweendo lwabuzuba bomwe musokwe, wakasika, waakukala munsi lyakasamu, wakakumbila kuti afwe, Wakati, Cazulila, Kondinyanzya buumi bwangu, O Jehova, nkaambo nsili mubotu kwiinda bamatata. ",
