        {
          "text": "Wakati, Ndasungwaalila Jehova Leza wamakamu abusungu bupati, nkaambo bana ba-Israyeli basowa cizuminano cako, bamwaya zipaililo zyako, bajaya basinsimi bako apanga, lino mebo ndasyaala endike, abwalo buumi bwangu balayandaula kubunyonyoona. ",
