        {
          "text": "Wakati, Koya, ukaime acilundu kubusyu bwa-Jehova. Elyo Jehova wakainda, nkabela muuwo uungisya wakapwaya zilundu akuvwinyauna mandomba kubusyu bwa-Jehova, pele Jehova takakali mumuuwo pe. Kusule lyamuuwo kwakasika muzuzumo wanyika, pele amwalo mumuzuzumo Jehova katamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
