        {
          "text": "Lino wakazwa oko, wakaakujana Elisha mwana wa-Safati, uli mukulimya basune maamba aali ikumi aabili, ajamba lyakumi aabili walo mwini nguwakali kulilimya. Nkabela Eliya wakainda nkwaakabede, wamuvumbya cibaki cakwe. ",
